{%- comment -%}
  Besjaar Club — loyalty programme page (2026-10-06).

  Members are customers with a Besjaar account (Shopify customer accounts:
  sign-in with a one-time code by e-mail). The page only promises what is set
  up in Shopify:
  - welcome discount = "Welcome code" (WELKOM20: 20% off the showerhead and
    shower-filter collections, once per customer);
  - member price = the automatic discount "Besjaar Club – ledenprijs" (20%
    off the shower-filter collection on every order for the customer
    segment "Besjaar Club-leden", does not combine with other product
    discounts). It needs no code, so the page never shows one for it: Google
    Merchant Center lists it as the loyalty program's member price and
    checks this page against that (2026-10-07);
  - orders and tracking in the customer account.
  The welcome code is printed only for signed-in customers. Clearing the
  welcome code or unticking "Member price" takes that benefit off the page
  everywhere (intro, card, perks, FAQ,
  terms), so a discount that is ended in Shopify can be removed here in one
  step. The percentages are settings too: keep them equal to Shopify >
  Discounts.

  Sign-in uses routes.storefront_login_url, which brings the customer back
  to this page after the e-mail code, so the codes are there straight away.

  Copy is localised NL/EN/DE/FR/ES in the section, like besjaar-b2b. The
  "always included" row reads the shipping-zone snippet and the theme
  settings, so it says the same as the rest of the store. The calendar
  buttons build the reminder in the browser; nothing is sent to Besjaar.
{%- endcomment -%}
